{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the role of Judas Kerioth, a Shemerian oppressed by the corrupt Pleroman government. Since the Time of Tribulation, Judas has longed to join the zealots, a rebel group now in hiding. But when the Pleromans arrest his childhood friend, Lena, on trumped-up charges, he\u2019ll do anything to save her\u2014even face off against the archons, mutated monsters with unimaginable power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-28-26-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first <i>Elohim Eternal</i>, players explored the world of Idin. In <i>Elohim Eternal II: Son of Man</i>, they will venture across the second planet in the kosmeos, Kenoma, a highly advanced, cyberpunk-inspired world on the brink of civil war. Kenoma and its legends draw inspiration from Judaism, Christianity, and Gnosticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-34-08-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a myriad of guns, all with their own abilities, stats, and perks. Mix and match guns to gain a tactical advantage over enemies in fast-paced turn-based combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-26-13-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot an azar, a huge mecha, in your fight against the Pleromans. Challenge the azar arena and reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is approximately 15 hours long. While not required, completing <i>Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code</i> is recommended for a fuller experience. Unlike video game series such as <i>Final Fantasy</i> and <i>Tales of...</i>, the <i>Elohim Eternal</i> series follows an overarching plot (similar to the <i>Trails of Cold Steel</i> series); however, each game in the series does present its own complete story.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/ee_series_graphic.png?t=1736178676\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330420?t=1736178676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330420?t=1736178676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/f6b70986f13fd8d6ccacf32d13d7818e30096d3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736178676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/f6b70986f13fd8d6ccacf32d13d7818e30096d3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736178676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the role of Judas Kerioth, a Shemerian oppressed by the corrupt Pleroman government. Since the Time of Tribulation, Judas has longed to join the zealots, a rebel group now in hiding. But when the Pleromans arrest his childhood friend, Lena, on trumped-up charges, he\u2019ll do anything to save her\u2014even face off against the archons, mutated monsters with unimaginable power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-28-26-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first <i>Elohim Eternal</i>, players explored the world of Idin. In <i>Elohim Eternal II: Son of Man</i>, they will venture across the second planet in the kosmeos, Kenoma, a highly advanced, cyberpunk-inspired world on the brink of civil war. Kenoma and its legends draw inspiration from Judaism, Christianity, and Gnosticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-34-08-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a myriad of guns, all with their own abilities, stats, and perks. Mix and match guns to gain a tactical advantage over enemies in fast-paced turn-based combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/2024-11-0511-26-13-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1736178676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot an azar, a huge mecha, in your fight against the Pleromans. Challenge the azar arena and reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is approximately 15 hours long. While not required, completing <i>Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code</i> is recommended for a fuller experience. Unlike video game series such as <i>Final Fantasy</i> and <i>Tales of...</i>, the <i>Elohim Eternal</i> series follows an overarching plot (similar to the <i>Trails of Cold Steel</i> series); however, each game in the series does present its own complete story.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/extras/ee_series_graphic.png?t=1736178676\" /></p>","developers":["George Alexandros"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330420/header.jpg?t=17361